    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Charming villa style vacation home which commands unparalleled ocean views along the Wild Atlantic Way. Our Five-Star shoreline property is superbly positioned to provide discerning clients with splendid seclusion in a dreamlike setting. \r\n\r\nAs you would expect, all four bedrooms are ensuite, and the property is finished immaculately to give guests maximum comfort.\r\n\r\nReviews:\r\n\r\nBetty Roscommon\r\nAug 2016\r\nA family member rented this house for a week so I was invited to visit and was I glad I did...A beautiful new property, fully furnished with what I felt was an Italian influence. The view from the large patio of clew bay across to Achill is stunning. There is a relaxed feel to this large house which has four bedrooms, all with en-suite and a seperate jacuzzi bath room for relaxing after the long hike up Croagh Patrick, which can be seen from the side of the house. It is private and secluded from the main road. The house has a large well-equipped kitchen with a dining table. It is in close proximity to both Westport and Louisburg with ample pubs that serve food close by. I feel there is a small bit of work to be done here as the garden is unfinished however this does not take away from this stunning property. I would certainly like to return to this lovely house in the future."
      }
    ],
